{"id": 536, "date": "2026-10-05T18:22:42", "date_gmt": "2026-10-05T18:22:42", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/neonatal-intensive-care-unit-nicu/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/neonatal-intensive-care-unit-nicu/"}, "modified": "2026-10-07T18:20:05", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-07T18:20:05", "password": "", "slug": "neonatal-intensive-care-unit-nicu", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/hospital-specialist-treatments/neonatal-intensive-care-unit-nicu/", "title": {"raw": "Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU)", "rendered": "Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU)"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">The neonatal intensive care unit looks after premature babies and term newborns who need close monitoring and specialised treatment in their first weeks of life. MedLuxLife helps families coordinate admission to the NICU at our partner hospital, arrange transfers and medical records, and keep in touch with the care team. We support parents with travel, accommodation and translation so they can focus on their baby.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":453,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-dept-newborn-intensive-care-unit-nicu.jpg\" alt=\"Newborn Intensive Care Unit (NICU) - specialist hospital care\" class=\"wp-image-453\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Care for premature babies</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Close observation and treatment of babies born early, in a setting designed for their specific needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Care for unwell term newborns</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Monitoring and treatment for full-term babies born with health problems that require intensive care.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Round-the-clock care</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Treatment and nursing continue 24 hours a day, seven days a week, with changes in the baby's condition monitored continuously and recorded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Specialised equipment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Incubators, open care beds, respiratory support devices, monitors, medication pumps, central gas and oxygen supply and uninterruptible power systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dedicated neonatal team</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Physicians and nurses specialised in neonatal intensive care look after each baby.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Multidisciplinary input</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Doctors from other specialties are involved when needed to assess critical situations and adjust treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Birth and discharge summaries for the baby</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Pregnancy and delivery records of the mother</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU) consultation with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-c